# QA replay of What's New's tour:5 line, "Your extracts, clearer" (owner, 2026-10-15: "the highlight does weird
# movements and highlights the wrong things sometimes"). A developer build plays it with --dev-view --dev-script;
# how to run it, and what each still must show: whatsnew-tour-line.md beside this file. Times are in seconds.

# A --dev-view session starts on settings of its own, as at a first start, so the tour opened by itself at chapter 1
# once the data was there. It ends first, so that the click below opens the tour as it opens for a player.
tour end
# Customs' artwork read once, so chapter 5's map comes at once; then the player's own map is Woods, not Customs, so a
# map of the player's put back under the tour would show.
map customs
wait 3
map woods
wait 4

# 0.5.0's card (Hyena), the version the owner's report was on: "whatsnew 0.5.0" shows that version's card alone, as help's
# link shows the newest's (a later version's is the newest now).
whatsnew 0.5.0
wait 1

# Line 4 of 0.5.0 is the tour:5 line, "Your extracts, clearer": the pointer onto it and a tap there. The tour opens
# at chapter 5, YOUR SCREENSHOT KEY, and stages its example on Customs.
whatsnew 0.5.0 click 4
wait 0.4
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-tour-line\t0
wait 1.2
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-tour-line\t1
wait 2
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-tour-line\t2

# The pointer leaves the line, as the tour's layer coming over it makes it leave. Before the fix, the chapter's map
# went 0.3 s later and the player's came back under the tour.
whatsnew leave
wait 0.5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-tour-line\t3

# The chapter's later moments: the example extract list read, the view taking in its extracts, the extracts ringing out,
# and the chapter's end, after the roll call's cue has gone (it stands about 6.4 s; the waits keep to it with the
# snapshot step of 2026-10-26, about 0.7 s, the developer view's tabs taken while the script goes on).
wait 3
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-tour-line\t4
wait 5
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-tour-line\t5
wait 3
snapshot %TEMP%\shturmap-qa\whatsnew-tour-line\t6
exit
